This repository contains an Apache License 2.0-licensed overlay for Dex.

Dex is Copyright The Dex Authors and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
The overlay uses the official Dex container as its upstream base and rebuilds
the exact locked Dex source with Go 1.27.0. A bounded AraiHu source overlay
adds local-password profile fields to Dex's existing protobuf API and maps
them to fields already implemented by Dex storage and authentication code.
Dex remains responsible for authentication, storage, connector, session, MFA,
and protocol behavior.

